      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An adjacent creature hits the ochre jelly with a Strike that would deal slashing or piercing damage</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A gout of acidic jelly shoots out at the attacker. The attacker must attempt a DC 22 Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The attacker is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The attacker takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> acid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The attacker takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> acid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The attacker takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> acid damage and 2 persistent plus acid damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
